{"title":"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/a/22a4fe673e25e8dde8d739b552d46f783110e5b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^x=8^{y+1}$\" width=\"73\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/d/bbd457e65e5fe6f44bd44678174596377ab5b155.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9^y=3^{x-9}$\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />, find the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/d/d3da9f8c7fe0473fdd6f8597eff61d71fedda430.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/3/6e34e555ae5859b6efc18fdd6b98dd189baf3b78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 18 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 21 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 24 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 27 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />    \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/a/e7a21f8603c55c8f1ffc6c5df225d5037749aea2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^x = (2^3)^{y+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"99\" height=\"21\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/2/ff2f104bb966e2303eeb087417ec2a322585fe48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^x = 2^{3y+3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a90076ffa6906cafc64d5dd1016b2dd9c6b07c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3y+3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Similarly, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/d/edd4c91fce4f92dbceedf5354acf0badd6596190.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3^2)^y = 3^{x-9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"99\" height=\"21\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/9/f79d7a8aa198bd2240283a4fd896d1973dd2eb91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{2y} = 3^{x-9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/5/4d51e4954d6d66a5def79a87f46dd129e0c1762f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y = x-9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>By substitution, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/4/2a45d8eb8d3f65b117de482a278cadac6ce0d5fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y = (3y + 3) - 9 = 3y - 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"214\" height=\"20\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/c/61ca7058f9c648d6f3566523b37634d3be9fda82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />.  \n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/e/b5e72f4dc2337914380ea13960bda2d5f6626bbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3 \\cdot 6 + 3 = 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"142\" height=\"15\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/6/ae6b9f49d694bcc2ca32205a7a5cdfc0f4d6d3cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = 21 + 6 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"206\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME\" title=\"1964 AHSME\">1964 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1964 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1964\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</